# The ramp for a routing column three blocks wide, north to south: the lower
# north port, the climb down the middle column on stone steps, the upper south
# port, five blocks as in the ramp tile (see ramp). Turned half round it runs
# south to north.
tile ramp_ns_n
size 3 4 5
port N io 1 1 0
port S io 1 3 4

